    {
      "x": 620,
      "y": 1290,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:cue-pass",
      "type": "geo",
      "props": {
        "w": 1080,
        "h": 260,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "dash": "draw",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1,
        "flipX": false,
        "flipY": false,
        "color": "green",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "size": "m",
        "font": "sans",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "middle",
        "richText": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "PASS WHEN the two lenses disagree about where a port is, and neither disturbs the other. Components shows S1 · service · robot, A1 · action · robot and ST1 · stream · camera, with sockets on whichever edge faces the component they talk to. Dataflow shows the same six cables with every socket back on a left or right lane. A port you drag in Components stays put when you flip to Dataflow and back."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a84za",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    {
      "x": 100,
      "y": 500,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:cue-step-2",
      "type": "geo",
      "props": {
        "w": 420,
        "h": 180,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "dash": "draw",
        "growY": 2,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1,
        "flipX": false,
        "flipY": false,
        "color": "orange",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "size": "m",
        "font": "sans",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "middle",
        "richText": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "2 · Press Service, then drag from anywhere on Mission's card onto Robot's. No ports, no port dots. Repeat with Action. Then Stream, Camera → Mission."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a3UZu",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    {
      "x": -18.851674641148335,
      "y": -195.93301435406704,
      "z": 0.7886792452830188,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "camera:page:page",
      "typeName": "camera"
    },
    {
      "x": 100,
      "y": 740,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:cue-step-3",
      "type": "geo",
      "props": {
        "w": 420,
        "h": 140,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "dash": "draw",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1,
        "flipX": false,
        "flipY": false,
        "color": "orange",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "size": "m",
        "font": "sans",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "middle",
        "richText": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "3 · Press ALSO › Tag edges. Every protocol leg appears beside the arrow it belongs to, auto-spaced."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a4HlE",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    {
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 330,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:cue-step-4",
      "type": "geo",
      "props": {
        "w": 420,
        "h": 180,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "dash": "draw",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1,
        "flipX": false,
        "flipY": false,
        "color": "orange",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "size": "m",
        "font": "sans",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "middle",
        "richText": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "4 · Press Dataflow. The generated ports are all on the left and right lanes — a socket that sat on a top or bottom edge is repositioned back."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a5ANE",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    {
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 570,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:cue-step-5",
      "type": "geo",
      "props": {
        "w": 420,
        "h": 160,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "dash": "draw",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1,
        "flipX": false,
        "flipY": false,
        "color": "orange",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "size": "m",
        "font": "sans",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "middle",
        "richText": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "5 · Still in Dataflow, press ALSO › Communication. The relationship arrows come back over the real routes and no port moves."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a6nlv",
      "typeName": "shape"
    },
    {
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 880,
      "rotation": 0,
      "isLocked": false,
      "opacity": 1,
      "meta": {},
      "id": "shape:cue-step-6",
      "type": "geo",
      "props": {
        "w": 420,
        "h": 190,
        "geo": "rectangle",
        "dash": "draw",
        "growY": 0,
        "url": "",
        "scale": 1,
        "flipX": false,
        "flipY": false,
        "color": "orange",
        "labelColor": "black",
        "fill": "semi",
        "size": "m",
        "font": "sans",
        "align": "start",
        "verticalAlign": "middle",
        "richText": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "6 · Back in Components with CARD › Port, press and HOLD a port dot on Camera, then drag it to another edge. Hold still first — moving straight away draws a cable instead."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "parentId": "page:page",
      "index": "a7B8j",
